This repository contains no source code or compiled WASM from Octarine
(https://github.com/mystic-finance/Stellar-RFQ). The test builds that WASM
from upstream commit 9afddd0acf08df16aaf404e35c79b4dc5bea97ce on the user's
machine. The upstream README and Cargo manifests declare Apache-2.0.

upstream-deps.lock lists the crates.io package versions and checksums that
were resolved from the upstream manifests.

fixtures/testnet-blend.json is captured public Stellar testnet state. It
includes contract WASM deployed by third parties, namely the testnet Blend v2
pool and its price oracle. Those programs remain under their authors' terms.
